    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-List Telecom Sim Historys-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM History Retrieval API provides access to historical data related to telecom SIM cards for auditing and reporting purposes. This endpoint allows users to retrieve a comprehensive list of SIM card histories, including activities and events associated with each SIM. It is particularly useful for telecom providers, analysts, and developers looking to enhance their system\u2019s visibility into SIM management. Typical consumers include business analysts and reporting tools aiming to optimize SIM lifecycle and usage insights.",
